OL,3,GNEWSASnooker player Graeme Dott goes on
OL,4,Atrial over child abuse allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former world snooker champion has
OL,7,Fgone on trial at the High Court in
OL,8,FGlasgow over child sex abuse charges.
OL,10,FGraeme Dott, 49, is accused of lewd and
OL,11,Flibidinous behaviour towards two
OL,12,Fyoungsters, a girl and a boy, between
OL,13,F1993 and 2010.
OL,15,FThe alleged incidents are said to have
OL,16,Foccurred on "various occasions" and
OL,17,Finvolved addresses in Glasgow's east
OL,18,Fend and South Lanarkshire as well as in
OL,19,Fa car.
OL,21,FDott, who won the world title in 2006,
OL,22,Fhas denied the charges against him.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
